      "updated": 1780589890347,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Effort     Primary Adapters              Model Default\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nLOW        kilo  ·  cursor  ·  opencode    kilo-auto/free  ·  auto\n           (gratis, rápidos, sin costo)    deepseek-v4-flash-free\n\nMED        copilot  ·  antigravity         gpt-5-mini\n           (balanceado, bajo costo)        Gemini 3.5 Flash (High)\n\nHIGH       claude  ·  agy  ·  copilot     sonnet --effort xhigh\n           (poder completo, preciso)       Gemini 3.1 Pro (High)\n                                           gpt-5.2-codex\n\nTHINKING   antigravity                    Claude Opus 4.6 (Thinking)\n           (razonamiento profundo)        [único con modo thinking]\n\nEXPLICIT   iris_task(adapter=\"claude\",    Bypasses routing\n            effort=\"high\")                Usa adapter especificado\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nCircuit Breaker: fallas ≥ 3 → skip adapter → fallback automático\nAuto-setup: iris_setup() verifica e instala dependencias CLI",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Effort     Primary Adapters              Model Default\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nLOW        kilo  ·  cursor  ·  opencode    kilo-auto/free  ·  auto\n           (gratis, rápidos, sin costo)    deepseek-v4-flash-free\n\nMED        copilot  ·  antigravity         gpt-5-mini\n           (balanceado, bajo costo)        Gemini 3.5 Flash (High)\n\nHIGH       claude  ·  agy  ·  copilot     sonnet --effort xhigh\n           (poder completo, preciso)       Gemini 3.1 Pro (High)\n                                           gpt-5.2-codex\n\nTHINKING   antigravity                    Claude Opus 4.6 (Thinking)\n           (razonamiento profundo)        [único con modo thinking]\n\nEXPLICIT   iris_task(adapter=\"claude\",    Bypasses routing\n            effort=\"high\")                Usa adapter especificado\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nCircuit Breaker: fallas ≥ 3 → skip adapter → fallback automático\nAuto-setup: iris_setup() verifica e instala dependencias CLI",
      "index": "ad",
      "frameId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2923076923076924
