      "text": "Models    haiku  ·  sonnet  ·  opus\nEffort    low  ·  medium  ·  high  ·  xhigh  ·  max\nCommand   claude -p \"{prompt}\" --model {alias} --effort {level} --output-format json\nOutput    JSON → result.result\n\nIris routing:\n  LOW   →  haiku --effort low\n  MED   →  sonnet --effort high\n  HIGH  →  opus --effort xhigh",
