      "text": "Models (string EXACTO en settings.json):\n  Gemini 3.5 Flash (Low)          ← LOW\n  Gemini 3.5 Flash (High)         ← MED  [current default]\n  Gemini 3.1 Pro (High)           ← HIGH\n  Claude Opus 4.6 (Thinking)      ← THINKING\n  Claude Sonnet 4.6 (Thinking)\n  Gemini 3.5 Flash (Medium)\n  Gemini 3.1 Pro (Low)\n  GPT-OSS 120B (Medium)\n\nCommand   agy --print \"{prompt}\" --dangerously-skip-permissions --print-timeout 15m0s\nEffort    embebido en nombre del modelo (no hay flag separado)\nOutput    stdout directo",
